#: openpilot\selfdrive\ui\layouts\settings\toggles.py
msgid "sunnypilot defaults to driving in chill mode. Experimental mode enables alpha-level features that aren't ready for chill mode. Experimental features are listed below:<br><h4>End-to-End Longitudinal Control</h4><br>Let the driving model control the gas and brakes. sunnypilot will drive as it thinks a human would, including stopping for red lights and stop signs. Since the driving model decides the speed to drive, the set speed will only act as an upper bound. This is an alpha quality feature; mistakes should be expected.<br><h4>New Driving Visualization</h4><br>The driving visualization will transition to the road-facing wide-angle camera at low speeds to better show some turns. The Experimental mode logo will also be shown in the top right corner."
msgstr "sunnypilot 默认以安稳模式行驶。实验模式启用尚未为安稳模式做好准备的 alpha 级功能。实验功能如下：<br><h4>端到端纵向控制</h4><br>让驾驶模型控制油门和刹车。sunnypilot 将按照它认为的人类驾驶方式行驶，包括为红灯和停止标志停车。由于驾驶模型决定行驶速度，设定速度仅作为上限。这是一个 alpha 质量的功能，应预期会出现错误。<br><h4>全新驾驶可视化</h4><br>低速时驾驶可视化将切换为广角路前摄像头，以更好地显示某些转弯。实验模式徽标将显示在右上角。"

#: openpilot\selfdrive\ui\widgets\offroad_alerts.py
msgid "sunnypilot detected a change in the device's mounting position. Ensure the device is fully seated in the mount and the mount is firmly secured to the windshield."
msgstr "sunnypilot 检测到设备安装位置发生变化。请确保设备完全安装在支架中，且支架牢固固定在挡风玻璃上。"

#: openpilot\selfdrive\ui\layouts\settings\device.py
msgid "sunnypilot is continuously calibrating, resetting is rarely required. Resetting calibration will restart sunnypilot if the car is powered on."
msgstr "sunnypilot 持续进行校准，很少需要重置。车辆通电时重置校准将重启 sunnypilot。"

#: openpilot\selfdrive\ui\layouts\settings\firehose.py
#: openpilot\selfdrive\ui\mici\layouts\settings\firehose.py
msgid ""
"sunnypilot learns to drive by watching humans, like you, drive.\n"
"\n"
"Firehose Mode allows you to maximize your training data uploads to improve openpilot's driving models. More data means bigger models, which means better Experimental Mode."
msgstr ""
"sunnypilot 通过观察像您这样的人类驾驶方式来学习驾驶。\n"
"\n"
"Firehose 模式让您最大化训练数据上传量，以改进 openpilot 的驾驶模型。更多数据意味着更大的模型，也就意味着更好的实验模式。"

#: openpilot\selfdrive\ui\layouts\settings\toggles.py
msgid "sunnypilot longitudinal control may come in a future update."
msgstr "sunnypilot 纵向控制可能在未来版本中提供。"

#: openpilot\selfdrive\ui\layouts\settings\device.py
msgid "sunnypilot requires the device to be mounted within 4° left or right and within 5° up or 9° down."
msgstr "sunnypilot 要求设备安装偏差在左右 4°、向上 5° 或向下 9° 以内。"

#: openpilot\selfdrive\ui\widgets\offroad_alerts.py
msgid "sunnypilot was unable to identify your car. Your car is either unsupported or its ECUs are not recognized. Please submit a pull request to add the firmware versions to the proper vehicle. Need help? Join discord.comma.ai."
msgstr "sunnypilot 无法识别您的车辆。您的车辆可能不受支持，或 ECU 未被识别。请提交拉取请求添加固件版本。需要帮助？加入 discord.comma.ai。"

#: openpilot\selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\vehicle\brands\toyota.py
msgid "sunnypilot will allow some Toyota/Lexus cars to auto resume during stop and go traffic. This feature is only applicable to certain models that are able to use longitudinal control. This is an alpha feature. Use at your own risk."
msgstr "sunnypilot 将允许部分 Toyota/Lexus 车型在走走停停的交通中自动恢复。此功能仅适用于能够使用纵向控制的特定车型。这是一个 alpha 功能，使用风险自负。"

#: openpilot\selfdrive\ui\sunnypilot\layouts\settings\vehicle\brands\toyota.py
msgid "sunnypilot will not take over control of gas and brakes. Factory Toyota longitudinal control will be used."
msgstr "sunnypilot 不会接管油门和制动控制，将使用 Toyota 原厂纵向控制。"

